/*  A rabbit's constant is a series, read by a function after the rabbit's `Done.`
    Broken: a constant lived in the rabbit, and every function may read it. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.  */

Pull a rabbit.
    Define sizes as a series of number with (11, 22, 33) permanently.
Done.
Bind number to total:
    Return the number of sizes + item 2 of sizes.
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    The tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State cast total.
